From 6d69773fcd87bc6eeb0b7ff5be8f6271f6ec200d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:59:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mobile): compact top bar and single hamburger sidebar
 toggle

- Unify every mobile top bar on one height variable (38px) with symmetric vertical padding + min-height, so bar content centers on the fixed .hamburger-btn axis; the hamburger's own top derives from the same variable.

- Replace the /logo.png brand image in the mobile hamburger button with an 18px stroke-1.5 three-line icon matching the built-in icon set (round caps, currentColor).

- Hide the duplicate four-grid page-sidebar toggles on mobile in Models and Workflow (Chat/GroupChat/Connections/History/AgentManager already hide theirs upstream). TerminalView keeps its toggle: the hamburger there opens the app nav drawer, not the terminal session list.

- KanbanView's two-row sticky header derives its top padding from the same variable so its first row stays aligned with the hamburger.
